    <div>
      <h2>Spell checker</h2>
      <p>It is already available in PriEco, but it needs to be much more accurate and support every language that PriEco supports.</p>
      <p>It needs to consider user's language preference, common QWERTY keyboard misclicks, understand the entire query to better infer its meaning and be aware of brand names to avoid correcting them.</p>
